<title>USA: Battle Lake ISD 542, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Battle Lake ISD 542, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $7.900 million of Battle Lake ISD 542, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.55 percent.</p>
</text>
